% expect-output: EfterScript
% expect-output: 3
% expect-output: true
% expect-output: true
% Scenario: default identity. A bare interpreter's statusdict holds its
% own product string and nothing but product, version, and revision;
% both statusdict and serverdict are writable, and serverdict holds
% exitserver. The reference converter answers with its own identity,
% so its output differs by design.
% Expect: EfterScript, 3, true, true.
statusdict /product get =
statusdict length =
statusdict wcheck serverdict wcheck and =
serverdict /exitserver known =
